ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Nieva y nieva sin parar!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¡Qué bonita manera de empezar
el día, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Es hört nicht auf zu schneien!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Was für eine schöne, verschneite
Landschaft das gibt, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
¡La nieve es como si fuera confeti
para celebrar tu visita,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Don't let the cold scare you away.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Stick around for a while,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Que no te asuste un poco de frío!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
En cuanto te muevas un poquito
se te pasará,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non farti intimidire dal freddo!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Spero che resterai in giro
per un po',{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Hola de nuevo! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}No tiene pinta de
que vaya a parar de nevar pronto,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Sono così felice di rivederti{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Fa un freddo da non credere!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Copriti bene, se pensi di restare
fuori a lungo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Oh, ich freu mich so, dich zu sehen{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Es ist fürchterlich kalt hier.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich hoffe, du hast warme Socken
an, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Seni yine gördüğüme çok sevindim{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Dışarısı epey soğuk,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} uzun süre dışarıda
kalacaksan sıkı giyin olur mu, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Oye!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pasear aquí fuera es como estar
dentro de un congelador.
